        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/5fdf1eb5a480eaafd77c138840468caa.poster.avif?t=1775222834\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/5fdf1eb5a480eaafd77c138840468caa.webm?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/5fdf1eb5a480eaafd77c138840468caa.mp4?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Helping Hand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive VR experience that will challenge you with puzzles, tension and a creature to protect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Thrilling Adventure That Will Keep You on Edge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Helping Hand</i>, you find yourself trapped in a house haunted by dark entities. But you are not alone. A mysterious newborn creature desperately needs your help to survive. Your mission? Work together, solve puzzles and find a way to escape before the shadows lurking in the house catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/eb7775b8146684dc38a10a5f4d567e9f.poster.avif?t=1775222834\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/eb7775b8146684dc38a10a5f4d567e9f.webm?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/eb7775b8146684dc38a10a5f4d567e9f.mp4?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles and Interact with the Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie rooms, manipulate objects, and use the environment to your advantage to overcome obstacles and dangers. Each puzzle is designed to take full advantage of virtual reality, offering a highly immersive and realistic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/30f3f56d83abaccb715f8ce5dc8748cc.poster.avif?t=1775222834\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/30f3f56d83abaccb715f8ce5dc8748cc.webm?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/30f3f56d83abaccb715f8ce5dc8748cc.mp4?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect a Unique Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The small creature by your side is more than just a traveling companion—it’s a key part of the gameplay. Communicate with it, understand its needs and combine your abilities to survive. But be careful… if it falls into the wrong hands, it’s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/7c56f203c9b84f09585960d5e2eb77b9.poster.avif?t=1775222834\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/7c56f203c9b84f09585960d5e2eb77b9.webm?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/7c56f203c9b84f09585960d5e2eb77b9.mp4?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Shadows That Hunt You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in this house. Something evil lurks in the darkness, watching you. You’ll need to move carefully, stay silent and find ways to outsmart the creatures that are after you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported VR Headsets:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oculus Meta Quest 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oculus Meta Quest 3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oculus Meta Quest 3s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playstation Vr 2 (Requires PlayStation®VR2 App)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For different headsets check the compatibility testing the free demo.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/5fdf1eb5a480eaafd77c138840468caa.poster.avif?t=1775222834\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/5fdf1eb5a480eaafd77c138840468caa.webm?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/5fdf1eb5a480eaafd77c138840468caa.mp4?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Helping Hand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive VR experience that will challenge you with puzzles, tension and a creature to protect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Thrilling Adventure That Will Keep You on Edge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Helping Hand</i>, you find yourself trapped in a house haunted by dark entities. But you are not alone. A mysterious newborn creature desperately needs your help to survive. Your mission? Work together, solve puzzles and find a way to escape before the shadows lurking in the house catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/eb7775b8146684dc38a10a5f4d567e9f.poster.avif?t=1775222834\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/eb7775b8146684dc38a10a5f4d567e9f.webm?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/eb7775b8146684dc38a10a5f4d567e9f.mp4?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles and Interact with the Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie rooms, manipulate objects, and use the environment to your advantage to overcome obstacles and dangers. Each puzzle is designed to take full advantage of virtual reality, offering a highly immersive and realistic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/30f3f56d83abaccb715f8ce5dc8748cc.poster.avif?t=1775222834\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/30f3f56d83abaccb715f8ce5dc8748cc.webm?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/30f3f56d83abaccb715f8ce5dc8748cc.mp4?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect a Unique Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The small creature by your side is more than just a traveling companion—it’s a key part of the gameplay. Communicate with it, understand its needs and combine your abilities to survive. But be careful… if it falls into the wrong hands, it’s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/7c56f203c9b84f09585960d5e2eb77b9.poster.avif?t=1775222834\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/7c56f203c9b84f09585960d5e2eb77b9.webm?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/7c56f203c9b84f09585960d5e2eb77b9.mp4?t=1775222834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Shadows That Hunt You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in this house. Something evil lurks in the darkness, watching you. You’ll need to move carefully, stay silent and find ways to outsmart the creatures that are after you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported VR Headsets:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oculus Meta Quest 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oculus Meta Quest 3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oculus Meta Quest 3s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playstation Vr 2 (Requires PlayStation®VR2 App)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For different headsets check the compatibility testing the free demo.</p>",
        "short_description": "Helping Hand is a VR Puzzle Platform Game where the player has to save a newborn creature from a house haunted by dark presences. Collaborate with the creature, solve the puzzles and escape from the monsters which are hunting it in an adventure that will leave you breathless.",
